					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1722371); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1722371&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608822507" alt="Shaggydredlocks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1722371)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1722371); return false;" >Shaggydredlocks</a></span> <span class="odate time_1547092170 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">10 Jan 2019 03:49</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4114303">
									

<p>Congratulations to the winners of the <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/SCP/comments/91eo2m/introducing_the_scp106_photography_contest/">SCP-106 Photography Contest</a> held on r/scp!</p>
<p>The first image &quot;106 Emergence&quot;, the second image <a href="http://cinemamind.tumblr.com/post/176772821121/scp-106-door-by-cinemamind-licensed-under-cc">&quot;106 Door&quot;</a> and third image <a href="http://cinemamind.tumblr.com/post/176772819936/scp-106-victim-by-cinemamind-licensed-under-cc">&quot;106 Victim&quot;</a> were all won by Cinemamind, and each is released under CC-BY-SA 3.0.</p>
<p>I'd like to thank everyone who contributed, community members who voted in the subreddit and shared their thoughts, and also apologize for how long the process ended up taking!</p>
<p><strong>Update:</strong> &quot;Emergence&quot; has received an update, courtesy of <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1547222306" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span> to address concerns over the smile/realism.</p>
<p>&quot;Victim&quot; has also received the kaktus treatment to improve realism.</p>

